          <li class="pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-warmgray/50 w-fit"><span class="text-pink">+</span> Maybe you're posting (or not posting) and still wondering where your next client is coming from.</li>
          <li class="pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-warmgray/50 w-fit"><span class="text-pink">+</span> Maybe your email list has stalled, or it's growing but nobody's buying.</li>
          <li class="pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-warmgray/50 w-fit"><span class="text-pink">+</span> Maybe you've tried Instagram, then SEO, then Pinterest, and you still don't know what works.</li>
          <li class="pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-warmgray/50 w-fit"><span class="text-pink">+</span> Maybe you're tired of being "always on" just to stay visible.</li>
          <li class="pb-3 mb-3 border-b border-warmgray/50 w-fit"><span class="text-pink">+</span> Maybe you know your email list is one of the few things in your business you actually own, you're not sure how to grow it without living on social media.</li>
