        </ul>
        <p class="text-black font-bold mb-8">
          One of those hit? All six? I've got you my love.<br />
          <span class="text-pink">You're in the right place.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="text-black mb-6">
          That's exactly why I built this space around it, the email strategy, the collaboration playbook, and the simpler model that takes the weight off, so your email list (and your business) can grow without you being everywhere.
        </p>
        <p class="text-black mb-8">
          Because you don't need to post more, hustle harder, or carry it all alone. You need an email list that actually sells, relationships that open doors, and a system that keeps working <em class="italic">{"{even on the days you don't show up at all}"}</em>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="bg-white p-3 pb-8 rounded-sm shadow-xl rotate-3 max-w-xs">
          <img src="/images/desk-scene.jpg" alt="" class="w-full rounded-sm" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-warmgray/40 text-center">
      <p class="text-pink text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-3">The Kylie Kelly Promise</p>
      <p class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl italic font-bold">
        "I'm on a mission to help you get known, trusted, & selling to the right people, through email & real relationships. Never an algorithm."
